          "title": "ISSUE",
          "elements": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The issue in this matter is whether the North Carolina Department of Health and Human \nServices, Division of Medical Assistance (hereinafter “DMA”) correctly determined that Petitioner \nreceived overpayments totaling $7,538.10 for providing dental services to beneficiaries who were \ncovered under the Medicaid for Pregnant Women (“MPW”) program after those beneficiaries were \nno longer pregnant.",
