                },
                {
                  "text": "of the arguments and stipulations of counsel; the \nexhibits admitted; and the sworn testimony of each of the witnesses, viewed in light of their \nopportunity to see, hear, know, and recall relevant facts and occurrences, any interests they may \nhave, and whether their testimony is reasonable and consistent with other credible evidence; and, \nupon assessing the preponderance of the evidence from the record as a whole in accordance with \nthe applicable law, the undersigned makes the following:",
                  "bold": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "underline": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
